{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:06 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:06 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:06 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"陳山聰（右一）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/da5dbdc0b36ff6868c55a8f2c20c2e2b/2026-10/179240426875551.jpg\"/><p>今日第十場三班千六米，沈廄「包裝戰仕」被捧成1.9倍大熱開跑，賽前更獲視帝陳山聰打氣，結果此馬不負眾望，在潘頓胯下順利取得跨季三連勝。賽後馬主李文斌與陳山聰等一眾好友齊齊拉頭馬，場面相當熱鬧。</p><img alt=\"「包裝戰仕」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7139c8aeac8e1574bff57c9fef7c124e/2026-10/179240430251846.jpeg\" title=\"「包裝戰仕」\"/><p>「包裝戰仕」</p><img alt=\"陳山聰\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4254c1e1d8795483a7e454654cbcf843/2026-10/179240430221671.jpeg\" title=\"陳山聰\"/><p>陳山聰</p><img alt=\"陳山聰打氣成功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ea3e662249f33d55926dc6cd2fc5449f/2026-10/179240430294110.jpeg\" title=\"陳山聰打氣成功。\"/><p>陳山聰打氣成功。</p><img alt=\"開心拉頭馬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/67424e4ee4e79e2b8bcb2ddbc75643fb/2026-10/179240430244383.jpeg\" title=\"開心拉頭馬。\"/><p>開心拉頭馬。</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:20:01.775933+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:06:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T13:17:45.387102+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:17:34.999554+00:00","content_hash":"ece91e5c9235d3e8e376b45c3826eefc76c53c06966d0288fa4021213bdf9dd5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}